+
+#### [Tiledesk Design Studio](https://github.com/Tiledesk/design-studio)
+> **Description:** Design Studio is Tiledesk’s no-code visual builder, presented in the README as a graph-based interface for conversations and automations. Restaurants can use a tool like this to prototype menu Q&A flows, event inquiries, waitlist notices, and order-status conversations before wiring those flows into backend systems. GitHub shows it as MIT licensed, primarily TypeScript, with 426 stars and a last commit date of Nov 28, 2025. It is not a full restaurant product on its own, but it is a practical UI layer for teams that want to iterate on conversational operations quickly.
+
+- **GitHub:** [github.com/Tiledesk/design-studio](https://github.com/Tiledesk/design-studio)
