+#### [Tock](https://github.com/theopenconversationkit/tock)
+> **Description:** Tock positions itself as an open conversational AI platform with an NLP stack, bot studio, analytics, and connectors for text and voice channels including WhatsApp and Alexa. For restaurants, that combination fits omnichannel guest assistance, branded ordering assistants, and multilingual support across web and messaging surfaces. GitHub lists it as Apache-2.0 licensed, primarily Kotlin, with 589 stars and a last commit date of Nov 21, 2025. It is a strong option for engineering-led teams that want a more structured, toolkit-oriented approach than lightweight chatbot repos typically provide.
+
+- **GitHub:** [github.com/theopenconversationkit/tock](https://github.com/theopenconversationkit/tock)
