+#### [Pipecat](https://github.com/pipecat-ai/pipecat)
+> **Description:** Pipecat is an open source Python framework for real-time voice and multimodal conversational agents, and its README emphasizes composable pipelines that orchestrate transports, speech, and model services. That maps directly to restaurant phone ordering, kiosk voice UX, and live receptionist-style agents. GitHub shows a BSD-2-Clause license, Python as the main language, 9,647 stars, and a last commit date of Jan 5, 2026. The project is attractive for restaurants because it is built around real-time interactions rather than delayed chatbot exchanges, which matters for phone calls and ordering flows.
