+
+> Best AI tools for restaurants 2026 is a curated list of open source GitHub repositories that restaurants can actually self-host or adapt for guest messaging, voice ordering, menu OCR, forecasting, and internal automation. Direct restaurant-specific open source AI repos are still rare, so this list broadens into adjacent production-grade tools that map cleanly to restaurant workflows.
